[{"title":"孙氏沱西别业","author":"薛蕙","text":"巴陵西来沱水深，水边楼阁自阴阴。\n鼋鼍夜出洞庭岸，虎豹昼啼云梦林。\n鼓枻乍逢渔父笑，搴舟时听越人吟。\n卜居何日从公去，拟向桃花处处寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20555,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨霁","author":"薛蕙","text":"西堂薄暮暄气微，雨霁清风飘我衣。\n明月在户稍将出，白云向空犹自飞。\n寄身世路有倾侧，抗志神游无是非。\n仙人胡乃不来下，接身山林同子归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20556,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄邢伯舆","author":"薛蕙","text":"仙掖自通青琐闼，近臣多在紫薇垣。\n苑中云去金茎出，仗内风来赤羽翻。\n天上谏书藏太史，人间诗句见开元。\n独怜卧病秋江客，愁对蓬蒿日满园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20557,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日禁中即事","author":"薛蕙","text":"驰道春归入建章，九重花卉动年芳。\n浮云细细生城阙，晴雪霏霏湿苑墙。\n内殿徐停红羽仗，御屏高闭紫金床。\n日长退食天门里，惭愧中朝鸳鹭行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20558,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"李子中林懋易曹仲礼王稚钦夜过分韵得凉字","author":"薛蕙","text":"拂簟移尊净客堂，朔云燕月满宫墙。\n建章露湿金茎冻，太液波侵玉树凉。\n海内风流今下榻，天涯疾病旧沾裳。\n攀欢自惜形容异，留赠空惭翰墨香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20559,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖","author":"薛蕙","text":"苑外西湖似若耶，翠湍锦石象云霞。\n春深杜若已满径，日暖凫鹥正在沙。\n胜地欲令谁作主，浮生安得此为家。\n直须轻舸随烟雾，还仗新诗对物华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20560,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道院看牡丹","author":"薛蕙","text":"四月红芳尚满枝，仙家春色怪来迟。\n彩云自解停歌扇，香雾时能堕酒卮。\n隔槛流莺愁并语，过帘轻燕巧相窥。\n无劳地主留坚坐，贪为名花醉不归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20561,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自西山归经西湖遇雨","author":"薛蕙","text":"恰向山头窥泛滥，旋从湖畔望嵯峨。\n云轻不隔翠微色，雨细初增绿水波。\n树影离离岩际少，鸟声噭噭雾中多。\n未愁沾湿穿花去，更拟青春载酒过。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20562,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送许伯诚侍御之江南","author":"薛蕙","text":"金门散吏著书成，乌府仙人揽辔行。\n七国早时先报捷，三吴今日尚屯兵。\n锦帆深驻芙蓉苑，紫盖高悬虎豹营。\n久拟功名望公等，愿看风采慰苍生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20563,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送李子中","author":"薛蕙","text":"洞庭山前水满湖，尔行乘舸向东吴。\n宦游坚不废丘壑，燕坐真成在画图。\n历历村墟悬橘柚，层层洲□散菰蒲。\n即看秀色增江国，䞉寄新诗入帝都。","collection":"明","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20564,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"河曲避暑","author":"薛蕙","text":"水曲楼台多景地，坐中名胜列仙儒。\n茂林脩竹非人世，清簟疏帘似画图。\n素柰味甘宜冻醴，红蕖香酷掩熏垆。\n秪言习气浑消尽，依旧呻吟据槁梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20565,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小园纳凉简子正侍御","author":"薛蕙","text":"晚夏歊蒸气倍骄，小园清旷暑全消。\n玉壶日映冰呈露，纨扇风生月动摇。\n窗下素床横绿绮，阶前锦石覆红蕉。\n草堂事事堪娱客，祗苦高人不可招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20566,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对雨有怀","author":"薛蕙","text":"乍淡乍浓云片片，半疏半密雨丝丝。\n林花落尽渐成子，巢燕飞来频哺儿。\n坐对空尊应笑客，行骑羸马欲寻谁。\n平生欢友俱南北，此日伤心独咏诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20567,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友人枉过有作","author":"薛蕙","text":"久卧田庐惯闭关，那期好事到林间。\n风光坐惜三春暮，琴酌聊为一日闲。\n青苔满院偏宜坐，红蕊盈条不忍攀。\n莫怪夕阳催客起，会邀明月伴君还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20568,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元夕郡巾招观灯不赴","author":"薛蕙","text":"遥闻郡阁夜张灯，走马来看病未能。\n坐失繁华春可惜，转添衰惫老堪憎。\n风流那比高门客，寂寞翻如苦行僧。\n欲写诗篇酬节序，短檠垂灭砚生冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20569,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西亭宗室送白牡丹一本走笔书此寄谢","author":"薛蕙","text":"曾傍瓜田搆药栏，欲凭光景慰衰残。\n聊同楚客怜芳草，敢冀梁园送牡丹。\n老病只疑花解笑，春风预想雪成团。\n攀援不减三株树，报答真惭双玉盘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20570,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自赋常乐园一首","author":"薛蕙","text":"谯国城南稍又东，一丘新买卧衰翁。\n人非九品羲皇上，园似千花佛界中。\n隐几自堪消永日，褰裳何待御泠风。\n文章习气今应尽，著意题诗也未工。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20571,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"孔汝锡得陜右少参邸报台中旧养一鹤俄鸣舞而去汝锡感而赋诗因同作一首","author":"薛蕙","text":"使君拥传西征日，孤鹤依依恋主鸣。\n阶下起为垂翅舞，云间去作断肠声。\n几年枉沐乘轩宠，五里能忘返顾情。\n颍水今朝应暂别，缑山他日会相迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20572,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"辛卯春日作","author":"薛蕙","text":"满榻尘埃两鬓丝，六年懒赋一篇诗。\n非关多病捐文字，实恐无闻近死期。\n何物乾坤能不朽，此生精力欲安施。\n春来忽有挥毫兴，正是风花烂漫时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20573,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病起偶作","author":"薛蕙","text":"肺气新年何太频，掩关风雨动经旬。\n春寒稍稍妨觞咏，人事纷纷可笑嗔。\n晚岁禅心了无住，平生龙性独难驯。\n杜康未是忘忧物，细读维摩究病因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20574,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清秋","author":"薛蕙","text":"清秋散发倍逍遥，岁暮谁言不自聊。\n空服九华真饮露，静听万籁似闻韶。\n风流祗合专丘壑，名利端须远市朝。\n十载已无干禄梦，故人何事苦相招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20575,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"木犀次万侍御韵","author":"薛蕙","text":"木犀旧种开何晚，今岁初开拟细看。\n叶薄青瑶云弄影，花明金粟露生寒。\n妙香闻处遥支策，小朵簪时屡拭冠。\n独绕芳丛成百匝，西风忘却葛衣单。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20576,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"龙潭","author":"薛蕙","text":"龙潭日落鸟飞回，坐拂扁舟下钓台。\n尚父已无西伯载，狂奴翻使汉庭猜。\n江湖万里人空老，宇宙千年凤不来。\n忽被渔翁笑相问，棹歌何事亦悲哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20577,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪霁","author":"薛蕙","text":"雪霁山房病骨清，自移一榻卧南荣。\n娟娟梅蕊含春色，漠漠松阴变午晴。\n世路收身真稳在，年光触眼可怜生。\n短筇预向邻翁借，伴我东风绕郭行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20578,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春南园作","author":"薛蕙","text":"眼看花鸟繁华日，心醉烟霞锢疾人。\n月下啼乌长达曙，雨中垂柳不胜春。\n应门僮仆能延客，旁舍渔樵竞卜邻。\n莫羡夔龙扶圣代，总输巢许得天真。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20579,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨晴再次前韵","author":"薛蕙","text":"残雨阑珊渐复稀，薄云零落会须归。\n阶前碧草穿泥出，叶底黄蜂伺日飞。\n馀润迟迟留宝篆，乍暄稍稍著罗衣。\n风光点检无多在，文酒追随莫更违。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20580,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中客至","author":"薛蕙","text":"客病荒村饶寂寞，故人今雨忽遇逢。\n别来渴疾春增剧，坐久空厨午未舂。\n束湿焚枯真简略，看云听竹稍从容。\n慇勤更觅邻家酒，惆怅初闻野寺钟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20581,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"海棠","author":"薛蕙","text":"醉倚雕阑倒玉壶，贪看锦树色敷腴。\n根株海外何年至，风韵花中绝代无。\n西子浣纱低照影，文君酤酒正当垆。\n少陵才调难摹写，浪把燕脂污画图。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20582,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中对雨忆南园牡丹","author":"薛蕙","text":"宾客门前问疾回，图书案上乱成堆。\n卧闻片雨空阶滴，想见名花别墅开。\n油幕纵然藏锦树，画阑定自污苍苔。\n东风好为催春霁，扶病还须载酒来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20583,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"南园观牡丹时雨霁病亦适愈","author":"薛蕙","text":"朝来盥漱喜新晴，忽忆看花遽出城。\n病起好怀还似昨，雨馀春色可怜生。\n露华濯濯含金粉，云朵鳞鳞蹙绛英。\n苦恨品题无妙语，正缘佳丽若为评。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20584,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹送寺中供佛兼题短句","author":"薛蕙","text":"盥手薰香折好春，罗巾净拭宝瓶尘。\n一华聊复添僧供，半偈还同赞法轮。\n宿世曾为童子戏，他生应作比丘身。\n若教灵运真成佛，会现优昙證本因。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20585,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"薛蕙","text":"红紫纷纷次第稀，故留国色殿春晖。\n东皇巧思应多少，西子妖魂定是非。\n香雾氤氲笼宝靥，流风宛转弄仙衣。\n白头更觉钟情剧，忍诉清尊不醉归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20586,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄刘希尹","author":"薛蕙","text":"吏部当年第一流，何知谪宦遽归休。\n数遭唇吻真销骨，久困风波竟覆舟。\n梦里不须惊宠辱，胸中那可著穷愁。\n近闻东海多方士，愿与刘安物色求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20587,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小饮芍药下作","author":"薛蕙","text":"白发逢春取醉频，多情倍复惜馀春。\n绿尊故是忘忧物，红药浑如绝代人。\n放旷山林真得意，崇高富贵不关身。\n二豪度量非同调，未用规规笑伯伦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20588,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日南园","author":"薛蕙","text":"幽林长日少炎氛，坐石临流每日曛。\n靡靡轻萝翻爽吹，泠泠脩竹度行云。\n樽中尤物唯思醉，身后空名不拟闻。\n宿昔燕京多酒伴，白头愁绝恨离群。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20589,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小圃杂莳药草偶成四律 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"昔年汉殿含香客，此日谯城种药翁。\n已分长休辞宦达，只愁多病迫途穷。\n发因青烛仍回绿，眼为黄精一驻红。\n少缓营魂游岱岳，定攀仙驾访崆峒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20590,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小圃杂莳药草偶成四律 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"脩道那能饭一麻，延年聊欲饵丹砂。\n青缯赍去寻三秀，玉盌盛来服九华。\n身寄人间长厌世，梦游天上已为家。\n会追姑射乘云气，不用羲和驻日车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20591,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小圃杂莳药草偶成四律 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"百药畦边一草堂，荷锄抱瓮送年光。\n红垂枸杞枝枝满，绿袅菖蒲节节长。\n雨霁云芽偏动色，风来石蕊故添香。\n五符不识三天字，更乞仙人别寄将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20592,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"小圃杂莳药草偶成四律 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"老来服散护残年，检尽桐君第几篇。\n误信朝霞能却粒，空闻水玉解乘烟。\n更生命薄丹砂耗，叔夜材凡石髓坚。\n自有仙乡终不到，莫同鸡犬望升天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20593,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"瑩心亭观荷花作","author":"薛蕙","text":"瑩心亭上逍遥客，照眼池中烂漫花。\n白苧单衣销暑日，玉盘纤手送朝霞。\n身闲但觉牵诗思，年老方知爱物华。\n笑听采莲频度曲，惊看垂柳乍栖鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20594,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病夫","author":"薛蕙","text":"平生心迹重相违，再到长安再乞归。\n本以顽疏难偶俗，不缘忧患始忘机。\n倦游但谓栖迟是，小隐焉知出处非。\n海内故人多问讯，病夫新制芰荷衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20595,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀","author":"薛蕙","text":"当年草奏尚书省，俟罪闲居已白头。\n但使奸䛕破心胆，宁辞老死向山丘。\n董生不识平津阁，李广那论校尉侯。\n富贵区区非我事，饭蔬饮水复何求。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20596,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"懒慢","author":"薛蕙","text":"旧来懒慢耽黄老，祗拟山林寄此生。\n傲吏未甘从薄宦，愚公翻笑窃高名。\n乌皮几上闻天籁，瘿木尊中遗世情。\n莫谓栖迟空白首，人间扰扰亦何成。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20597,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏允吉侍御孔汝锡佥宪同觞小园薄暮值雨骤作四韵奉呈二公","author":"薛蕙","text":"内台兼约行台使，南郭相寻负郭翁。\n行径追随双盖并，草堂洒扫一尊同。\n饮中仙侣逢苏晋，坐上嘉宾接孔融。\n正喜淹留乘暮雨，莫辞颠倒醉秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20598,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中秋对月作","author":"薛蕙","text":"可怜三五最佳月，更爱风烟万里晴。\n金魄乘秋偏皎镜，青霄入夜转分明。\n纷纷宝气浮沧海，隐隐仙歌落玉京。\n不惜绮裘侵露坐，只愁银汉向西倾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20599,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"花下","author":"薛蕙","text":"昨朝花始发，今朝花已稀。\n那为风吹落，自是鸟惊飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20600,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"草堂","author":"薛蕙","text":"终朝草堂上，独凭乌皮几。\n有时白云来，相见窗户里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20601,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"通许馆对月","author":"薛蕙","text":"花上月纤纤，蛾眉映绣帘。\n从今三五夕，相伴客愁添。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20602,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳孙氏山中五咏 其一 泉源","author":"薛蕙","text":"泉源不可到，想像青云杪。\n由来此路遥，莫谓游人少。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20603,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳孙氏山中五咏 其二 流觞渠","author":"薛蕙","text":"流觞泛激水，手揽跳波湿。\n恰怪杯行迟，风吹忽相及。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20604,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳孙氏山中五咏 其三 月桥","author":"薛蕙","text":"泊舟板桥口，月出溪水绿。\n何处采菱归，遥闻榜歌曲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20605,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳孙氏山中五咏 其四 云洞","author":"薛蕙","text":"洞门双玉扇，隔岫窥云雾。\n袅袅三石梁，苔滑不敢度。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20606,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"滁阳孙氏山中五咏 其五 留客亭","author":"薛蕙","text":"亭中留客处，客至亦忘归。\n把酒看春草，西山日已微。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20607,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"御沟","author":"薛蕙","text":"夹城开玉槛，内苑抱金沟。\n宫女停珠佩，仙人上綵舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20608,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西园","author":"薛蕙","text":"西园一游瞩，正及上春时。\n荧荧花变色，漠漠水生姿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20609,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"纳凉","author":"薛蕙","text":"空林露华湿，开阁徙清尊。\n月出芙蓉水，风生鸣鹤园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20610,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晚春","author":"薛蕙","text":"日长莺语歇，中酒眠高阁。\n庭院寂无人，春风扫红萼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20611,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早秋","author":"薛蕙","text":"为爱新秋至，朝来步水滨。\n微风犹未起，凉意满青蘋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20612,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟","author":"薛蕙","text":"落叶积沙水，寒花带石丛。\n白鸥随病客，日日泛溪中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20613,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"中夜观月出","author":"薛蕙","text":"残露洗青霭，倾河流素晖。\n自为生迟暮，遂令相赏稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20614,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋浦","author":"薛蕙","text":"秋浦多香草，当年怨楚臣。\n安知千载后，尚有广骚人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20615,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东皋","author":"薛蕙","text":"东皋落日明，西候新飙冷。\n徘徊磐石上，爱此青松影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20616,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"早春","author":"薛蕙","text":"白发常多感，青春亦不平。\n落梅饶惨澹，新柳太鲜明。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20617,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其一","author":"薛蕙","text":"一径垂杨高下，数家流水东西。\n麦陇青青雉雊，柴门寂寂莺啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20618,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其二","author":"薛蕙","text":"稚子自操井臼，老农共话桑麻。\n采药常随樵客，乘篮时造僧家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20619,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其三","author":"薛蕙","text":"荷锸朝耘瓜圃，披衣夕偃蓬庐。\n瓮里数升绿酒，枕中一卷丹书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20620,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其四","author":"薛蕙","text":"官罢交游自绝，病闲琴酒相亲。\n门下惟饶饮客，坐中时有谈宾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20621,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其五","author":"薛蕙","text":"萝蔓半垂瓮牖，松阴全覆茅轩。\n数声鸡犬深巷，一曲烟霞小园。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20622,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其六","author":"薛蕙","text":"扫石旋铺琴席，临流试泛酒卮。\n山水依依可恋，风尘扰扰何为。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20623,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"田园乐七首 其七","author":"薛蕙","text":"碌碌俯头辕下，栖栖垂翅笼中。\n遮莫朝端巧宦，何如谷口愚公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":20624,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]